### Add first student
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentId":101,"studentName":"Rahul","email":"rahul@example.com","courseName":"CSE","programmingScore":90,"mathematicsScore":80,"technicalSkills":["Java","MySQL"]}

### Add second student
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"studentId":102,"studentName":"Aman","email":"aman@example.com","courseName":"CSE","programmingScore":40,"mathematicsScore":90,"technicalSkills":["Java","HTML"]}

### All
GET http://localhost:8080/students

### ID
GET http://localhost:8080/students/101

### Merit
GET http://localhost:8080/students/merit

### Common skills
GET http://localhost:8080/students/skills

### Improvement
GET http://localhost:8080/students/improvement

### Email
GET http://localhost:8080/students/email/rahul@example.com

### Course
GET http://localhost:8080/students/course/CSE

### Update
PUT http://localhost:8080/students/101
Content-Type: application/json

{"programmingScore":95,"mathematicsScore":85,"technicalSkills":["Java","Spring Boot"]}

### Delete
DELETE http://localhost:8080/students/101
